{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366350/extras/office.gif?t=1749145992\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">START OF A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Actors, writers, producers, are getting murdered one by one in cold blood. No one is safe. Play the first two cases of this Hollywood story. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366350/extras/question_witnesses.gif?t=1749145992\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A VARIED AND REALISTIC CAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double-dealing, backstabbing, betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is what it seems in the world of stars. Take a peek behind the curtains, learn what's going on behind the glistering fa\u00e7ade. Meet a varied cast of characters, discover their secrets and ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful... they may end up in a body bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366350/extras/notebook.gif?t=1749145992\" />  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEDUCTIVE GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the crime scene, find clues, piece together what happened, find the culprit! Reveal what's the true reason behind these\u00a0<strong>Confidential Killings</strong>. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366350?t=1749145992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366350/2d7f1740bcc2c608a8b7da9b3b837cd2899a3b97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749145992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366350/241cfae157f25751089747e1e1b2d401e1ac00cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749145992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea